this nickname, because it makes people believe that he is smarter than he is. Despite this, he still allows Kaname to call him by it."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c72043"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fe/fe11e9f6ddb7fc74a8e3854636aa491ccdd9dbc3664e7028defe7a9c09cc4b9e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b7/b7972f6a367be5afa55336f000528538aee8f23dc12fd28ae823eb65f9ea9525.webp","width":105,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小林 ゆう","creatorId":"vndb:s246","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s246","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s246","name":"小林 ゆう","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:18326","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c72044","characterName":"櫛名田 眠","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c72044"},"originalCharacterName":"櫛名田 眠","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"15"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Nemuru is the only daughter of the head of the Kushinada clan, the family with the most political power and presence in Jōga. Nemuru, as part of her role as the Hunter, patrols the city at night clad in an elaborate ceremonial outfit and wolf mask and wielding a scythe, hunting for Godmen who have succumbed and started to attack the Fallen, whom she is charged with executing. She is the class president of Hiroshi's class. Nemuru is initially very cold to Hiroshi because she considers him to be a danger. Despite this, she eventually warms towards him and they become friends."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c72044"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1a/1a0eacddc48df351e55beeab77ea06ff2d0127b08e5feb2a93122a3b422644a0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bf/bf0ee79f42ffd5f7671ea8d5583eb60e80cecd75a3791a8d202196009c5f179f.webp","width":73,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"伊瀬 茉莉也","creatorId":"vndb:s4898","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4898","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4898","name":"伊瀬 茉莉也","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:18333","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c72045","characterName":"摘花 五十鈴","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c72045"},"originalCharacterName":"摘花 五十鈴","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"15"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Isuzu lives close to Hiroshi. She is tomboyish and extremely affectionate towards Hiroshi, sometimes to his dismay. She had an older brother named Issei, who attended university before succumbing to his predatory instincts and attacking Hiroshi. He was killed by Nemuru. She herself starts to submit and attacks Hiroshi, but manages to stop herself and is spared her brother's fate."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c72045"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ca/ca24b607fc85076cd3600e570cf6d7e6c2992482cb8addee9e82386a2f32df3d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/52/52920b45295aeb41105def68234ae6f4c0ca864f38e0dc0a0c914c55110554c4.webp","width":104,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"加藤 英美里","creatorId":"vndb:s1190","sou